# Version directory for the `identity` model. MUST be an integer (`1`, `2`, ...).
# Triton silently skips non-integer dirs like `v1` or `latest`.
#
# The `identity` backend needs no weight file. For a real model, drop the
# weights here, e.g.:
#
#   model_repository/resnet50/1/model.onnx
#   model_repository/bert-large/1/model.plan
#   model_repository/preprocess/1/model.py
